	description "The Frequentia-class Freighter is most commonly found serving as a fuel tender for ships in larger fleets, taking advantage of its large and ungainly cargo receptacle to store enough cryogenic deuterium to satisfy a small fleet's needs during long journeys. While its spherical fuel tank can be drained and used to transport dry goods and cargo, the cargo bay's notoriously small access door makes loading anything that can't be moved with a pump an exquisitely painful process."


