	description "The Entasi is a mid-sized mining vessel, immediately recognizable by its pair of huge solar thermal generators. With the power and weapons capacity needed to support laser mining weapons, the Entasi is able to quickly and efficiently cut through asteroids, whose mineral contents can then be collected by the swarm of Sonikis cargo drones it can carry into an asteroid field."
	description "	While somewhat fragile, the energy and space available to the Entasi can make it a potent warship with the right modifications. Rumors abound that certain Entasi captains sympathetic to the Dissonance movement maintain a stockpile of weapons for this very eventuality."


