	description "The Undulon Orbital Silo was first envisioned as a cheap static defense satellite, little more than a tube capable of storing and launching nuclear-tipped missiles. Over time, this specialization was broadened, and the modern line of Undulons is capable of both mounting a large fixed gun and carrying the energy supply needed to support it. Their mostly hollow construction provides a great deal of internal space for their size, but also makes the drone quite fragile."
	description "	Undulons are usually seen defending critical planets and stations, ready to unload their atomic payloads on any hostile ships that jump into the system."
	description "	Drones do not come equipped with a hyperdrive. You cannot carry a drone unless you have a ship in your fleet with a drone bay."


