mission "Coalition: Struggling Author 2"
	name "Help Anna register with the Heliarchy"
	description "Take Anna Fangvin to the <destination> so she can register with the Heliarchs."
	source "Ki Patek Ka"
	destination "Ring of Friendship"
	passengers 1
	to offer
		has "Coalition: Struggling Author 1: done"
	on offer
		conversation
			`You walk through the spaceport, looking for Anna. You find her in the middle of a public square, seated at a table with her laptop out. You figure she must've intended on getting started on some early work, what with the newly found inspiration of being in such an alien society, but it seems the sheer volume and diversity of peoples here on <origin> made her forget to type entirely.`
			`	She only seems to notice you when you also sit down beside her. "Oh, hello again, <first>!" she says, snapping back into focus. "Is the ship ready?"`
			`	Hearing an affirmative answer, Anna stands up from her chair and begins following you to the <ship>. She settles into her bunk as you prepare for the trip to the <destination>.`
				accept
	on enter "Quaru"
		conversation
			`As you enter <system>, Anna walks out of her bunk and finds a spot on the side of the bridge, peering into the empty void. "What a massive ringworld!" she exclaims.`
			choice
				`	"It's enormous. They stole it from the Quarg roughly seven thousand years ago."`
				`	(Say nothing.)`
			`	"This is going to be a great source of inspiration for my next novel," says Anna, still in awe. She pulls out a small notebook and begins busily writing in it.`
	on complete
		conversation
			`Anna is amazed as you touch down on the ringworld. As the two of you open the hatch, you see a Heliarch agent in front of you.`
			`	"Greetings, humans. For you, what can I do today?" asks the Heliarch. You respond that you would like to register Anna with the Heliarchy. Upon reaching the registration office, Anna enters, and fifteen minutes later exits alongside another Heliarch, this time a crowned Saryd. "They finally got all the paperwork done. We're off to the spaceport to get some food. Meet us there to discuss our next move."`


