				goto thanks
			label "half a year"
			`	"Required to stay with Anna, you are not, but if you wish to, stay with her you may. Return to human space, you are free to do," says the Kimek.`
				goto "rest of interview"
			label "lounge"
			`	You leave the room and walk to the lounge. There are several tables where many Kimek are chatting in their native language, while a few Saryds and Arachi are visibly relaxed. You sit at an empty table to pass the time, occasionally going to the water dispenser to hydrate yourself.`
			`	After thirty minutes, a Kimek approaches you. Their translation device speaks. "An alien in our space, you are? Most strange, this meeting truly is. A Coalition member the likes of you, I have never encountered. Or... ahmm... from outside of our space, are you?"`
